.alert.alert-light.border
  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Goal of this page
  %p.mb-3
    Understand this seat's status, reporting context, defense for hiring it, and the job description people would step into.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Context
  = render "shared/maap/definition"

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Specifics of this page
  %ul.mb-0
    %li
      %strong Status
      (Draft → Being Considered → Open → Closed) changes on the edit page. Filled is set automatically when someone is assigned via Seat Management. Archive and Restore use Actions — same pattern as other MAAP objects.
    %li
      Archived seats are view-only until you
      %strong Restore to Draft.
    %li
      Only
      %strong Open / unfilled
      seats appear in the Seat Management seat picker.
    %li Use the seat switcher in the header to jump between seats. Edit sits next to it.
